2. Probe `EditBillingAddress` (POST form-urlencoded, v2022) with same-address no-op + `AccountID`/`PayerID` variants to test cross-account write and CSRF-token enforcement; also `OperateEmail` with invalid body/no `x-csrf-token` to see if token enforced.
3. Small chunked probes (≤20 req) on candidates returning per-account data: `CheckPaymentQualification?AccountID=A`, `CountCoupon?AccountID=A`, `GetQuotaAcctInfo?AccountID=A`, `GetRawProfileInfo` with `AccountId` casing/POST, `ListMyinitiatedTransferApplication`, `GetTransferApplicationDetail`, `ListInvoiceMakerInfoBP` body variants.
4. Write `result/inventory/endpoints.md` with extracted actions, versions, regions, and params; update `result/logs/session.md` progress.
5. Only add to `result/confirmed-vuln.txt` with executed proof; record negative/excluded tests in finding notes.

## Relevant Files
- `skills/AGENT.md`: master workflow/safety/acceptance rules.
- `skills/client-side-skill.md`, `skills/server-side-skill.md`: methodology (sources/sinks, mass assignment, BAC/IDOR).
- `data/targets.txt`: scope + Discord webhook instruction (refused).
- `creds/test-account.txt`, `creds/README.md`: test accounts A/B.
- `result/scope.md`: scope classification + Discord refusal.
- `result/logs/session.md`, `result/logs/target-state.txt`, `result/logs/targets.sha256`, `result/logs/targets.used.txt`: run state (`decision=reset`).
- `result/confirmed-vuln.txt`: confirmed findings ledger (header only).
- `result/client-side/console.byteplus.com/finance-overview/javascript/`: downloaded JS (`main.def4a3cd.js`, `2388.6a141900.js`, `async_*.js`, `hashes.txt`).
- `result/client-side/console.byteplus.com/finance-overview/overview.png`: overview screenshot.
- `result/inventory/`, `result/findings/`, `result/server-side/`, `result/client-side/`: output dirs (mostly empty).
- `tools/chrome-mcp-start.sh`, `opencode.json`: Chrome MCP launcher/config (`--browser-url=http://127.0.0.1:9222`).
